notes.content:
Hello everyone, a new update is available. Here's the main points:

- Support for more screen aspect ratios;
- Tweaks to hard mode in 4.3 to allow more paths in the bottom section in hard mode;
- Further smoothed the movement of the ghost indicator in the HUD;
- Fixed a collider that could potentially kill you in 3.1 at the end of a flashback;
- Fixed the collectible notifications not using the same color to fill while holding down the button as collectibles in-game;
- Fixed an issue where level names were sometimes visible on locked levels in the level selection menu.

If you encounter any issue, please post a discussion thread or ping us on Discord http://discord.gg/lightfall
